**Read:** [Research Roadmap on Grid-Forming Inverters](../sources/Grid-Forming-Inverters-Research-Roadmap.lingua#r_1XBSV4CPJGZG5FE56MH7507WAF), entire model, stability and interaction discussion; [Power System Dynamics and Control — A. M. Kulkarni](../sources/Power-System-Dynamics-and-Control-Kulkarni.lingua#r_2T4WS3TCPCXRB5JEH7HTN5FAHQ), complete analysis and multimachine/control methods; [DPsim — electromagnetic-transient and dynamic-phasor methods](../sources/DPsim-Transient-and-Dynamic-Phasor-Methods.lingua#r_6Y8PGZBGJHGV3JHZ1Q8XC77RR3), whole relevant domain/model methods; [Feedback Systems — Åström and Murray](../sources/Feedback-Systems-Astrom-Murray.lingua#r_7N4SZEXCRGZZFW2EV9X86G7833), complete applicable feedback/robustness development.

Several individually well-behaved components can interact through finite network impedance and shared controls. Define ports, frames, operating point, frequency band and closed/open-loop boundaries before combining impedance or state-space descriptions. A scalar approximation may omit sequence/frame coupling or control states relevant to the observed mode.

Derive a small source-filter-load or two-controller example and compare an impedance-based argument, a state-space linearization and an independent time response. Retain delays, limits and actual measurement paths. A small-signal conclusion is local; nonlinear transitions such as current limiting need separate evidence. Distinguish control, resonance, rotor-angle, voltage and frequency phenomena without assuming their labels imply independent systems.

Read the full relevant dynamic/converter methods and at least one complete primary case chosen for the mechanism. Vary a parameter not used in fitting and predict the resulting mode/response. Examine whether an RMS model omits a phenomenon requiring EMT. State numerical, parameter and model uncertainty separately. This graduate investigation connects abstract stability to an actual physical interface rather than treating one impedance plot or software eigenvalue as a universal certificate.

